<title>AUSTRALIA: BHP appoints chief scientist.</title>
<headline>BHP appoints chief scientist.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Broken Hill Pty Co Ltd said on Monday that it had appointed Bob Watts, currently ICI Professor of Chemistry at the University of Melbourne, to the new position of chief scientist.</p>
<p>Watts, who will take up his appointment from August 1, will head up BHP's research laboratories at Clayton in Melbourne.</p>
<p>BHP said Watts had wide experience as a research scientist in Australia, the United States and Europe.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
